WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.278 --> 00:00:06.278
Invention actually is the nectar,

00:00:06.391 --> 00:00:09.043
is the thing that's critical to progress. 

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.734
And MIT is a place which is about invention. 

00:00:14.935 --> 00:00:17.851
I suppose there was a sense of slight coming home,

00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:19.391
finding this place,

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:23.442
there seemed to be a different level of 

00:00:23.442 --> 00:00:30.309
exceptional focus on progress through ideas

00:00:30.309 --> 00:00:32.309
and developing those ideas.

00:00:34.581 --> 00:00:39.137
Whether you call something design or engineering or architecture,

00:00:39.137 --> 00:00:40.549
to me it's all the same. 

00:00:40.549 --> 00:00:43.480
And it felt like MIT did put it all together.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:47.585
And was about ideas, so getting this letter

00:00:47.585 --> 00:00:51.687
suddenly saying, you're being offered this

00:00:51.687 --> 00:00:55.219
incredible, um, honor or award.

00:00:55.219 --> 00:00:58.837
My heart sort of went, "ah!"

00:00:58.837 --> 00:01:04.970
as a sort of link to somewhere whose values I charish.

